{"id": "EUVD-2026-98936", "enisaUuid": "bd9a77bf-99fc-3b66-9d9c-e8517fb22046", "description": "bbs-go through 4.4.6 contains a stored cross-site scripting vulnerability that allows authenticated users to upload HTML or SVG files by spoofing the multipart Content-Type in POST /api/upload. Attackers can upload script-bearing documents served inline from /res and send their URLs to administrators, executing script on the forum's origin.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T16:53:06", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-14T15:59:17", "baseScore": 5.1, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:N/SC:L/SI:L/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/mlogclub/bbs-go/issues/305", "https://github.com/mlogclub/bbs-go/blob/v4.4.6/internal/pkg/uploader/uploader.go#L90-L121", "https://github.com/mlogclub/bbs-go/blob/v4.4.6/internal/handlers/api/upload_handlers.go#L36-L54", "https://github.com/mlogclub/bbs-go/pull/306", "https://github.com/mlogclub/bbs-go/commit/5bebf98bb9e0ac5162d4f8faf7a65fc0d496a362", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/bbs-go-through-4.4.6-stored-xss-via-image-upload-content-type"], "aliases": ["GHSA-rm26-pxjp-76q3", "CVE-2026-110103"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.23, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "faf2a4f6-ba88-3050-a783-a901390acffc", "product": {"name": "bbs-go", "vendor": {"name": "mlogclub"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22644.4.6"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "b7aaac6b-ae99-37b2-9f5c-b6825a7b48dc", "vendor": {"name": "mlogclub"}}], "isExploited": false}